<TITLE>4.6.1.4. Graphical Residual Analysis - Initial Model</TITLE>
</HEAD>

<BODY BGCOLOR="FFFFCC">

<IMG SRC="../../gifs/nvgtbr.gif" BORDER=0 VALIGN="TOP" ISMAP USEMAP="#MenuBar">
